Package: statofact-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, systemd, iproute2, dpkg
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: statofact <root@localhost>
Description: Statofact CMDB agent
 Reads hardware, network, listening services, and installed Debian package
 data (including versions and dependencies) and reports it via HTTP.
 Runs periodically through a systemd timer.
 Supports active reporting and passive collection over SSH.
 Configure /etc/statofact-agent.conf after installation.
